### Test Download API Endpoints
### Gunakan REST Client extension di VS Code untuk menjalankan file ini

### 1. Generate Academic Content terlebih dahulu
POST http://localhost:3000/api/content/academic-content/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jenis_konten": "Materi Pembelajaran",
  "topik": "Fotosintesis pada Tumbuhan",
  "mapel": "Biologi",
  "kelas": "10",
  "panjang": "sedang",
  "bahasa": "Indonesia",
  "gaya_bahasa": "Akademik dan Informatif",
  "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### 2. Get All Academic Contents (untuk mendapatkan ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/content/academic-content/

### 3. Download Academic Content as PDF
### Ganti YOUR_CONTENT_ID dengan ID yang didapat dari step 2
GET http://localhost:3000/api/content/academic-content/download/YOUR_CONTENT_ID/pdf

###############################################

### 4. Generate Presentation terlebih dahulu
POST http://localhost:3000/api/content/presentation/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topik": "Pengenalan Sistem Tata Surya",
  "jumlah_slide": 8,
  "tujuan": "Menjelaskan struktur dan komponen tata surya",
  "audiens": "Siswa SMP",
  "include_catatan": true,
  "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### 5. Get All Presentations (untuk mendapatkan ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/content/presentation/

### 6. Download Presentation as PPT
### Ganti YOUR_PRESENTATION_ID dengan ID yang didapat dari step 5
GET http://localhost:3000/api/content/presentation/download/YOUR_PRESENTATION_ID/ppt

###############################################

### 7. Generate Syllabus terlebih dahulu
POST http://localhost:3000/api/content/syllabus/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mata_pelajaran": "Matematika",
  "kurikulum": "Kurikulum Merdeka",
  "jenjang": "SMA",
  "tingkat_kelas": "10",
  "semester": "Ganjil",
  "tahun_ajaran": "2024/2025",
  "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### 8. Get All Syllabi (untuk mendapatkan ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/content/syllabus/

### 9. Download Syllabus as PDF
### Ganti YOUR_SYLLABUS_ID dengan ID yang didapat dari step 8
GET http://localhost:3000/api/content/syllabus/download/YOUR_SYLLABUS_ID/pdf

### 10. Download Syllabus as DOCX
### Ganti YOUR_SYLLABUS_ID dengan ID yang didapat dari step 8
GET http://localhost:3000/api/content/syllabus/download/YOUR_SYLLABUS_ID/docx

###############################################

### 11. Generate Unit Plan terlebih dahulu
POST http://localhost:3000/api/content/unit-plan/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "judul_unit": "Sistem Persamaan Linear",
  "mata_pelajaran": "Matematika",
  "tingkat_kelas": "10",
  "tujuan_pembelajaran": "Siswa mampu memahami dan menyelesaikan sistem persamaan linear dua variabel",
  "jumlah_pertemuan": 3,
  "durasi_per_jp": 45,
  "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### 12. Get All Unit Plans (untuk mendapatkan ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/content/unit-plan/

### 13. Download Unit Plan as DOCX
### Ganti YOUR_UNIT_PLAN_ID dengan ID yang didapat dari step 12
GET http://localhost:3000/api/content/unit-plan/download/YOUR_UNIT_PLAN_ID/docx
